                    "props": {
                      "id": "Text-history",
                      "align": "left",
                      "className": "",
                      "content": "<p>St. Joseph Parish began in 1921, when a handful of families started meeting for Mass in a rented hall on Main Street. The church they built a few years later still stands at the corner of Church Street, and today the parish is home to families from all over Anytown.</p><p>We're a parish of all ages: young families, students, longtime parishioners and newcomers. Together we worship, serve our neighbors through the food pantry and visiting the sick, and support the parish school.</p>"
                    }
